Triage (NOT auto-fixed in this patch set):
- The only fix for `next`/`postcss` is a breaking major upgrade (next@16.3.8);
  `nanoid` has a non-breaking fix available via `npm audit fix`.
- A Next.js 14 -> 16 major upgrade is a product/compat decision, out of the minimal
  supply-chain scope of PS-08; it is surfaceable/automatable through the new
  Dependabot config and is recorded as an open question.
- This is why SUPPLY-P2-001 is `partially-fixed`, not `verified-fixed`.

